  (b) Methodology volumes under `volumes/` are published for reading, verification,
      and citation. Content describing Tiers 11–12 entities shares the AGPL-3.0
      status of those entities. Content describing Tiers 13–18 entities
      (P.T 61–90) remains Savant-Commercial-1.0 methodology: public to read,
